  "traps": [
    "settings.gradle.kts names the root project klaxon-root and includes klaxon and klaxon-jackson; buildSrc is a separate build that Gradle runs first, so it is a unit but not a member",
    "the Kotlin plugin version is the constant KOTLIN_VERSION = \"1.6.0\" in buildSrc/src/main/kotlin/KlaxonConfig.kt, read by kotlin(\"jvm\") version KOTLIN_VERSION in build.gradle.kts: a reader of the build script alone sees no version",
    "kotlin(\"stdlib\"), kotlin(\"reflect\") and kotlin(\"test\") carry no version: the Kotlin plugin 1.6.0 aligns them, so resolved is 1.6.0",
    "dependencies are declared through listOf(...).forEach { implementation(...) } loops: a reader that looks for implementation(\"group:name:version\") literals misses testng and assertj-core",
    "the root project declares implementation(project(\":klaxon\", \"default\")) and the same for klaxon-jackson, plus its own copies of the Kotlin libraries, TestNG and AssertJ, yet has no sources: only src/test/resources with JSON test data",
    "Kotlin files live under klaxon/src/main/java (Json.kt, KlaxonJsonProvider.kt, PathMatcher.kt, TypeFor.kt) next to KlaxonDoc.java: the Kotlin plugin compiles src/main/java too, so they belong to the main source set",
    "klaxon/build.gradle.kts sets group com.beust and version KLAXON_VERSION (5.7-SNAPSHOT from buildSrc) in an allprojects block, while the root sets group org.gradle.kotlin.dsl.samples.multiproject and version 1.0 for all projects",
    "kobalt/src/Build.kt (with kobaltw and kobalt/wrapper, Kobalt 1.0.129) is a second, older build of the same two modules: kobalt-project units klaxon and klaxon-jackson with the Gradle roots, whose versions disagree with the Gradle build (Kotlin 1.3.70, TestNG 6.13.1, AssertJ 3.5.2, javac -source/-target 1.7); project(klaxon) makes klaxon-jackson depend on klaxon",
    "gradle/publishing*.gradle are Groovy scripts that no build script applies",
    "the 5 .kts build scripts and buildSrc's KlaxonConfig.kt are build code: no KotlinCompile task of the main build compiles them",
    "no lock file: resolved is null except for the Kotlin libraries the Gradle Kotlin plugin aligns"
  ]
}
